config PAMIR_AI_SAM_MODULE
	tristate "Pamir AI Sensor and Actuator Module (SAM) driver"
	depends on SERIAL_DEV_BUS
	help
	  Say Y here to support Pamir AI's Sensor and Actuator Module (SAM)
	  for communication between the host processor and RP2040 microcontroller.
	  
	  This driver interfaces with hardware components on the CM5 device,
	  specifically handling button inputs and RGB LED control via UART.
	  
	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called pamir-ai-sam. 